"w":115,"h":29},{"text":"Email:","x":1324,"y":2131,"w":101,"h":30},{"text":"Email:","x":1323,"y":2375,"w":101,"h":29},{"text":"Email:","x":1321,"y":2618,"w":102,"h":29},{"text":"Arguments will be emailed to the contact person listed here for review before they are printed in the Sample","x":260,"y":2705,"w":1959,"h":40},{"text":"Ballot & Official Voter Information Pamphlets.","x":826,"y":2752,"w":825,"h":37},{"text":"Please complete the reverse side of this form.","x":824,"y":2800,"w":829,"h":38},{"text":"40 Tower Road, San Mateo, CA 94402","x":880,"y":2847,"w":716,"h":40},{"text":"P 650.312.5222 F 650.312.5348 email registrar@smcacre.gov web www.smcacre.gov","x":415,"y":2898,"w":1647,"h":43}]},{"page":2,"width":2436,"height":3156,"lines":[{"text":"Vote Yes on _: Repair Burlingame schools to protect high-quality local education and keep","x":318,"y":330,"w":1774,"h":46},{"text":"local students safe.","x":319,"y":393,"w":365,"h":32},{"text":"Burlingame Schools are at the heart of our community. For generations, we've delivered top-notch","x":320,"y":480,"w":1741,"h":48},{"text":"keeping both our schools and our community strong.","x":862,"y":542,"w":941,"h":47},{"text":"education to local students","x":319,"y":544,"w":471,"h":33},{"text":"But some of our schools are over 100 years old and their age is showing. Classrooms suffer from dry","x":318,"y":629,"w":1790,"h":49},{"text":"rot, leaky roofs, and outdated plumbing and electrical systems. We need to fix these problems now,","x":318,"y":690,"w":1743,"h":49},{"text":"so teachers have the tools they need and students can focus on learning in safe, modern classrooms","x":319,"y":751,"w":1756,"h":47},{"text":"---— not on bursting pipes.","x":316,"y":815,"w":444,"h":43},{"text":"repairs our classrooms and labs so we can continue our tradition of academic excellence.","x":534,"y":901,"w":1571,"h":48},{"text":"Measure","x":317,"y":906,"w":147,"h":31},{"text":"Every local student deserves safe, modern facilities that set them up for success in high school,","x":318,"y":960,"w":1678,"h":47},{"text":"college, and beyond.","x":317,"y":1024,"w":357,"h":43},{"text":"Yes on : Repair Aging Local Schools","x":315,"y":1115,"w":746,"h":42},{"text":"Protect high-quality academic instruction in core subjects like math, science, reading, and","x":454,"y":1204,"w":1574,"h":50},{"text":"writing","x":453,"y":1269,"w":124,"h":46},{"text":"Remove dry rot, lead, and asbestos","x":453,"y":1334,"w":615,"h":44},{"text":"Update science, technology, engineering, and math labs","x":453,"y":1399,"w":976,"h":45},{"text":"Fix leaky roofs","x":454,"y":1465,"w":258,"h":43},{"text":"Replace aging and inefficient plumbing and electrical systems","x":453,"y":1521,"w":1078,"h":45},{"text":"Provide teachers with the tools to prepare students for high school and college","x":453,"y":1575,"w":1395,"h":45},{"text":"All Measure _ Funds Stay Local for Burlingame Schools","x":313,"y":1680,"w":1106,"h":44},{"text":"• By law, all funds remain under local control and may only be used in Burlingame schools","x":383,"y":1733,"w":1634,"h":46},{"text":"• No funds can be taken by the State or Federal government","x":383,"y":1793,"w":1109,"h":44},{"text":"• An independent citizens' oversight committee and mandatory annual audits are required","x":383,"y":1846,"w":1627,"h":48},{"text":"Strong schools mean strong property values and a stronger community. Join parents, teachers, and","x":314,"y":1950,"w":1734,"h":48},{"text":"neighbors across Burlingame in voting yes.","x":314,"y":2006,"w":753,"h":43},{"text":"Yes on _ : Repair and Upgrade Local Schools","x":312,"y":2109,"w":882,"h":43},{"text":"FILED","x":1008,"y":2373,"w":94,"h":33},{"text":"FICE OF THE CHEF ELECTIONS OFFICER","x":693,"y":2418,"w":724,"h":43},{"text":"SAN MATEO COUNTY","x":882,"y":2471,"w":347,"h":36},{"text":"AUG II 2026","x":926,"y":2585,"w":263,"h":49},{"text":"DEY","x":930,"y":2828,"w":61,"h":30},{"text":"3","x":2215,"y":350,"w":43,"h":58},{"text":"7","x":2218,"y